WEBVTT

00:10:00.196 --> 00:10:01.347
It's a utility

00:10:01.371 --> 00:10:04.946
in a place where there are fewer
better options to solve a problem.

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:09.356
Investing in innovations that make
products much more affordable

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:11.139
for many people

00:10:11.163 --> 00:10:13.376
not only attacks this scarcity

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:16.117
but it creates a sustainable
source of revenue

00:10:16.141 --> 00:10:19.369
for governments to reinvest
into the economies

00:10:19.393 --> 00:10:21.912
to strengthen their institutions.

00:10:22.497 --> 00:10:26.215
This is the critical missing piece
in the economic development puzzle

00:10:26.239 --> 00:10:29.561
that will ultimately
help us reduce corruption.